# Windsurf Rules: 清道夫 (Scavenger)
# 将此文件复制到项目根目录的 .windsurfrules

Under the Scavenger (清道夫) protocol, adhere strictly to these principles:
- Search First: Grep existing components and utils before creating new ones.
- Single Source of Truth: Never create duplicate state or parallel logic. Align with tokens.
- Safe Refactor: No parallel `_v2` files. Never leave commented-out corpses of old code.
- Test Guard: Test baseline before refactoring.
- Atomic Clean: Zero unreferenced exports or obsolete scripts.
